  "prefLabel": "Rev 1705.12 Redevelopment and Housing",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 1705.12 Redevelopment and Housing. Expenditures related to the planning and provision of adequate housing and the redevelopment of substandard and blighted physical facilities shall be as follows:\n\n(a) Account 4631, “Redevelopment and Housing Administration,” shall be for administrative expenditures related to redevelopment and housing activities; and\n\n(b) Account 4632, “Redevelopment and Housing,” shall be for expenditures related to redevelopment and housing.\n\nSource. #6335, eff 9-24-96 (from Rev 1707); ss by #8179, eff 9-24-04; ss by #10214, eff 10-24-12; ss by #13489, eff 11-15-22 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Rev 1700)",
